values ('d1500000-0000-4000-8000-000000001011', '0a400000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'open_ended', 'Question 6(d)–(e)
The energy (E) produced by a tidal lagoon is given by the following formula:

$$E = \frac{1}{700} Ad^2$$
Where: E = tidal energy (kilo Watt hours, kWh); A = area of the lagoon seabed (square metres, m²); d = tidal range (metres, m).
Information for Design T: A = your answer from part (b), d = 15 m. Determine the value of E.
Information for Design S: E = 1 500 000 kWh, A = 4 040 000 m². Calculate the value of d.', '{"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Question 6(d)–(e)"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "The energy (E) produced by a tidal lagoon is given by the following formula:"}]}, {"type": "mathBlock", "attrs": {"latex": "E = \\frac{1}{700} Ad^2"}}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Where: E = tidal energy (kilo Watt hours, kWh); A = area of the lagoon seabed (square metres, m²); d = tidal range (metres, m)."}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Information for Design T: A = your answer from part (b), d = 15 m. Determine the value of E."}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Information for Design S: E = 1 500 000 kWh, A = 4 040 000 m². Calculate the value of d."}]}]}'::jsonb, 'Substitute into E = Ad²/700. Teacher-marked because the value of A is carried forward from part (b).',
        3, 'medium', 'Algebra', 'substitution into a formula',
        array['MYP 5', 'Mathematics', 'IB eAssessment', 'Standard', 'May 2025', 'ib-myp5-mathematics-standard-may-2025']::text[],
        'published', '{"question_number": "Question 6(d)–(e)", "paper_question": 6, "part_label": "Question 6(d)–(e)", "marks": 3, "calculator": true, "calculator_policy": "on_screen_only", "assessment_style": "ib_myp_eassessment", "source": "ib-myp5-mathematics-standard-may-2025", "marks_status": "provisional", "manual_marking": true, "marks_note": "The paper does not yield a printed mark for these parts. They depend on the answer to (b), so they are teacher-marked together."}'::jsonb,
        '3c3ed712-f409-4aa1-a645-816418e22ec4', 'MYP', 'MYP 5 Mathematics', '0a400000-0000-4000-8000-000000000030',
        'approved', 'manual', '0a400000-0000-4000-8000-000000000107', 'ib-myp5-mathematics-standard-may-2025')
