Due to a storm, d increases by 10%.
Determine the percentage increase of E.', '{"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Question 6(f) — 2 marks"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "The energy (E) produced by a tidal lagoon is given by:"}]}, {"type": "mathBlock", "attrs": {"latex": "E = \\frac{1}{700} Ad^2"}}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Due to a storm, d increases by 10%."}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Determine the percentage increase of E."}]}]}'::jsonb, '$E \propto d^2$, so $d \to 1.1d$ gives $E \to 1.21E$: a 21 % increase.',
