values ('d1500000-0000-4000-8000-000000001013', '0a400000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'assess_parts', 'Question 7 — 20 marks
The warehouse uses two different robots to move items.
The working area of the warehouse has a length of 32 m and a width of 16 m, shown in the following diagram.

[Figure: Warehouse working area — diagram not to scale]
All robots are designed to start at point A, move to pick up an item at point P, then move to drop off the item at point B.
Robot 1 can only move parallel to the walls of the warehouse, as shown in the diagram. Robot 1 is instructed to pick up an item at point P(16, 12).
Robot 2 can move directly from one point to another, as shown in the diagram. Robot 2 moves on the path from A to P using the equation y = ¾x.
Point
 | x
 | y

A
 | 0
 | 0

P
 | 16
 | 12

B
 | 32
 | 16

$$k = \frac{|D_2 - D_1|}{D_1} \times 100$$', '{"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Question 7 — 20 marks"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "The warehouse uses two different robots to move items."}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "The working area of the warehouse has a length of 32 m and a width of 16 m, shown in the following diagram."}]}, {"type": "graphBlock", "attrs": {"spec": {"version": 1, "title": "Warehouse working area — diagram not to scale", "domain": {"xMin": 0, "xMax": 34, "yMin": 0, "yMax": 18, "gridStep": null, "showGrid": true, "showAxes": true, "showCoordinates": false, "showLegend": false, "showIntersections": false, "equalScale": false}, "functions": [], "points": [{"id": "A", "x": 0, "y": 0, "label": "A", "color": "#b3441c", "showCoordinates": true, "open": false, "visible": true}, {"id": "P", "x": 16, "y": 12, "label": "P", "color": "#b3441c", "showCoordinates": true, "open": false, "visible": true}, {"id": "B", "x": 32, "y": 16, "label": "B", "color": "#b3441c", "showCoordinates": true, "open": false, "visible": true}], "segments": [{"id": "top", "x1": 0, "y1": 16, "x2": 32, "y2": 16, "color": "#0a5c36", "style": "solid", "width": 2, "label": "", "visible": true}, {"id": "right", "x1": 32, "y1": 16, "x2": 32, "y2": 0, "color": "#0a5c36", "style": "solid", "width": 2, "label": "", "visible": true}, {"id": "bottom", "x1": 0, "y1": 0, "x2": 32, "y2": 0, "color": "#0a5c36", "style": "solid", "width": 2, "label": "", "visible": true}, {"id": "left", "x1": 0, "y1": 0, "x2": 0, "y2": 16, "color": "#0a5c36", "style": "solid", "width": 2, "label": "", "visible": true}, {"id": "r1a", "x1": 0, "y1": 0, "x2": 16, "y2": 0, "color": "#1f4e79", "style": "dashed", "width": 2, "label": "", "visible": true}, {"id": "r1b", "x1": 16, "y1": 0, "x2": 16, "y2": 12, "color": "#1f4e79", "style": "dashed", "width": 2, "label": "", "visible": true}, {"id": "r1c", "x1": 16, "y1": 12, "x2": 32, "y2": 12, "color": "#1f4e79", "style": "dashed", "width": 2, "label": "", "visible": true}, {"id": "r1d", "x1": 32, "y1": 12, "x2": 32, "y2": 16, "color": "#1f4e79", "style": "dashed", "width": 2, "label": "", "visible": true}, {"id": "r2", "x1": 0, "y1": 0, "x2": 32, "y2": 16, "color": "#b3441c", "style": "solid", "width": 2, "label": "", "visible": true}], "annotations": [{"id": "w", "x": 14.2, "y": -0.9, "text": "32 m", "color": "#333333"}, {"id": "h", "x": -1.5, "y": 8.4, "text": "16 m", "color": "#333333"}], "strokes": [], "regions": [], "xLabel": "x", "yLabel": "y"}}}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "All robots are designed to start at point A, move to pick up an item at point P, then move to drop off the item at point B."}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Robot 1 can only move parallel to the walls of the warehouse, as shown in the diagram. Robot 1 is instructed to pick up an item at point P(16, 12)."}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Robot 2 can move directly from one point to another, as shown in the diagram. Robot 2 moves on the path from A to P using the equation y = ¾x."}]}, {"type": "table", "content": [{"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableHeader", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Point"}]}]}, {"type": "tableHeader", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "x"}]}]}, {"type": "tableHeader", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "y"}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableCell", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "A"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "0"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "0"}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableCell", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "P"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "16"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "12"}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableCell", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "B"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "32"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "16"}]}]}]}]}, {"type": "mathBlock", "attrs": {"latex": "k = \\frac{|D_2 - D_1|}{D_1} \\times 100"}}]}'::jsonb, 'D₁ = (16 + 12) + (16 + 4) = 48 m. PB has gradient (16 − 12)/(32 − 16) = 1/4 and equation y = ¼x + 8. PB = √272 ≈ 16.49 m, so D₂ = 20 + 16.49 = 36.49 m. k = |36.49 − 48|/48 × 100 ≈ 23.97.',
